  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COPROSEM Onion Seed Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Vegetable seed production.Beneficiaries: 69 (23 women) plus seed buyers.Description: COPROSEM aims to increase their production of lower cost certified Violet de Galmi onion seed for the Mali market, as well as in Senegal, which COPROSEM is well-placed to supply, as well as to begin to supply other certified vegetable seeds.</narrative>
  </description>
